{"translation":{"id":"aii_abt","name":"ܕܝܬܩܐ ܚܕܬܐ ܕܡܪܢ ܝܫܘܥ ܡܫܝܚܐ ܘܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ ܒܠܫܢܐ ܐܬܘܪܝܐ","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=aii","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=aii","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"ABT","englishName":"Assyrian Neo-Aramaic NT+Psalms","language":"aii","textDirection":"rtl","sha256":"1859152dbbffe55d2b7ac6d4c09fbad5a6416ca25359e69220bb358dac602444","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/books.json","numberOfBooks":28,"totalNumberOfChapters":410,"totalNumberOfVerses":10420,"languageName":"Assyrian Neo-Aramaic","languageEnglishName":"Assyrian Neo-Aramaic"},"book":{"id":"PSA","translationId":"aii_abt","name":"ܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ","commonName":"ܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ","title":"ܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ","order":19,"numberOfChapters":150,"sha256":"08b7c4463dda6adc56b2c377f42d67ace350af655720940a2e395776a718fc6c","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":150,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/150.json","totalNumberOfVerses":2461},"chapter":{"number":4,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["ܠܪܝܫ ܓܘܕܐ ܕܙܡܪ̈ܐ: ܒܩܝܬܪ̈ܐ. ܡܙܡܘܪܐ ܕܕܘܝܕ."]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"ܒܩܪܵܝܬ‌ܝܼ ܓ̰ܲܘܸܒ ܠܝܼ، ܝܵܐ ܐܲܠܵܗܵܐ ܕܙܲܕܝܼܩܘܼܬ‌ܝܼ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܓܵܘ ܐܘܼܠܨܵܢܝܼ ܩܵܡ ܡܲܪܘܸܚܸܬ ܠܝܼ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܪܲܚܸܡ ܥܲܠܝܼ ܘܫܡܹܥ ܠܨܠܘܿܬ‌ܝܼ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܝܵܐ ܒܢܲܝ̈ܢܵܫܵܐ، ܗܲܠܔ ܐܝܼܡܲܢ ܡܲܕܸܪܝܼܬܘܿܢ ܐܝܼܩܵܪܝܼ ܠܢܟ݂ܝܼܦܬܵ‌ܐ؟","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܗܲܠܔ ܐܝܼܡܲܢ ܡܲܚܸܒܝܼܬܘܿܢ ܣܪܝܼܩܘܼܬܵ‌ܐ، ܘܛܵܥܹܝܬܘܿܢ ܒܵܬܪ ܕܘܼܓܠܵܐ؟ ܣܹܠܵܗ","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܐܝܼܢܵܐ ܝܕܹܥܡܘܼܢ ܕܦܪܝܼܫ ܠܹܗ ܡܵܪܝܵܐ ܡܗܘܼܡܢܵܐ ܩܵܐ ܓܵܢܹܗ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܡܵܪܝܵܐ ܒܸܬ ܫܵܡܹܥ ܒܩܪܵܝܬ‌ܝܼ ܐܸܠܹܗ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܪܓܘܿܕܘܼܢ ܒܙܕܘܼܥܬܵ‌ܐ ܘܠܵܐ ܚܵܛܹܝܬܘܿܢ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܗܲܓܹܝܡܘܼܢ ܒܠܸܒܵܘܟ݂ܘܿܢ ܥܲܠܔ ܫܘܝܼܬܵܘܟ݂ܘܿܢ ܘܦܘܼܫܘܼܢ ܫܸܠܝܹܐ. ܣܹܠܵܗ","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܕܒ݂ܘܿܚܘܼܢ ܕܸܒ݂ܚܹ̈ܐ ܕܙܲܕܝܼܩܘܼܬܵ‌ܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܘܣܒܘܿܪܘܼܢ ܒܡܵܪܝܵܐ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܪܵܒܵܐ ܝܢܵܐ ܐܵܡܪ̈ܵܢܹܐ: ”ܡܵܢܝܼ ܡܵܨܹܐ ܡܲܚܙܹܐ ܠܲܢ ܛܵܒ݂ܬܵ‌ܐ؟“","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܡܲܪܸܡ ܥܲܠܲܢ ܒܲܗܪܵܐ ܕܦܵܬܘܼܟ݂، ܝܵܐ ܡܵܪܝܵܐ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܕܪܹܐ ܠܘܼܟ݂ ܦܨܵܚܵܐ ܒܠܸܒܝܼ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܒܘܼܫ ܙܵܘܕܵܐ ܡ̣ܢ ܙܲܒ݂ܢܵܐ ܕܦܸܪܝܘܼܬܵ‌ܐ ܕܕܲܚܠܵܝܗ‌ܝ ܘܚܲܡܪܵܝܗ‌ܝ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܒܫܠܵܡܵܐ ܒܸܬ ܕܵܡܟܹܢ ܐܘܼܦ ܒܸܬ ܛܵܠܥܹܢ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܣܵܒܵܒ ܐܲܢ݇ܬ ܒܢܲܦ̮ܫܘܼܟ݂، ܝܵܐ ܡܵܪܝܵܐ، ܒܫܲܝܢܵܐ ܒܸܬ ܡܲܫܪܹܝܬ ܠܝܼ.","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/4.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/5.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/3.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":8}